{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Ban all forms of Algorithmic Price Gouging & Discriminatory Personalised Pricing",
        "additional_details": "We call on the Government to ban any exploitative dynamic and personalised pricing across all goods and services. We are concerned that algorithms that adjust prices according to demand, consumer profiling, personal data, or predicted willingness to pay risk exploiting vulnerable consumers and deepening inequality. We want legislation to prohibit any unfair price increases and discriminatory profiling, fully protect consumer privacy, and require transparent pricing practices, while allowing genuine discounts and cost-based adjustments.",
        "background": "We ask the Government to legislate to ban any exploitative demand-based price increases or personalised pricing across all goods and services, where algorithms use consumer profiling, personal data, predicted willingness to pay or sudden increases in demand to maximise prices charged to consumers.",
